// The Python type check: pyright, the checker inside VS Code's Pylance, so the
// editor shows what blocks a push. Nothing is compiled; the annotations are
// read as written. The gate runs it (daily.py).
//
// "basic" over every script, at zero. "strict" (every parameter and return
// annotated, nothing Unknown) is switched on file by file in the list below,
// and when every file is in it the mode becomes "strict" and the list goes.
// JSON read from disk is the data boundary: dex.load/db/meta return `Json`
// (Any), the Python twin of docFromRow in the app.
{
  "include": ["scripts"],
  "pythonVersion": "3.12",
  "typeCheckingMode": "basic",
  "strict": []
}
